expression: "stdout(&[\"doctor\", \"explain\", \"--help\"])"
---
Ask an OpenAI-compatible LLM for grounded, cited hypotheses

Usage: modde doctor explain [OPTIONS] --game <GAME> <LOG_PATH>

Arguments:
  <LOG_PATH>  

Options:
      --data-dir <DATA_DIR>          Override data directory (default: ~/.local/share/modde or $`MODDE_DATA_DIR`) [env: MODDE_DATA_DIR=]
      --game <GAME>                  
      --heap-profile <HEAP_PROFILE>  Write a DHAT heap profile. Requires the `heap-profile` cargo feature [env: MODDE_HEAP_PROFILE=]
      --profile <PROFILE>            
      --provider <PROVIDER>          [default: local] [possible values: local, remote]
      --json                         
  -h, --help                         Print help
